---
const siteUrl = '/prstk-lab/';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>找不到頁面｜PRStK Lab</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href={`${siteUrl}assets/styles.css`} />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-muji-bg text-muji-text flex items-center justify-center px-6">
    <main class="max-w-md text-center rounded-3xl border border-muji-border bg-white/85 p-8 shadow-sm">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-muji-muted">PRStK LAB</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold">這個頁面不存在</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muji-muted">返回入口，繼續探索投資研究工具。</p>
      <a class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-full bg-muji-brand px-6 py-3 text-sm text-white" href={siteUrl}>回到首頁</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
